  "body": "uconv encoded U+301C as U+FF5E. Chromium does not, at least in the ISO-2022-JP case. Can't test Edge and IE right now, because software.hixie.ch is down.\r\n\r\nI'm not saying we should do this, but let's at least give this multi-person evaluation.",
